WEBVTT - Rajeshwar Yadav Testimonial (English)

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
I am Rajeshwar Yadav, aged 56, from Mauganj village near Rewa, Madhya Pradesh.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.500
After experiencing severe chest pain, the district hospital advised urgent cardiac stenting.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Private hospitals quoted ₹1,65,000, which would have forced us to mortgage our farmland.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Aapka connected us with their pre-negotiated tertiary care partner and facilitated 42% cost reduction through transparent tariffs.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Today I am back home farming, debt-free and healthy. Aapka is a true blessing for rural families.
